From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:28:23 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 07/22] qwen3_5: the mHC contract runs: five cases at the
 served width, FP64 references, a control each

The committed contract never compiled; it also freed its cases before the gates, unloaded its module before
launching, wrote outputs into its inputs and kept one stream of the merge. Cases: router branch, router
pre/post/mix, merge (in place), enter and leave at hidden 4096, rows 1 to 4096, each with a planted control.
Registered in contract_family_sets.zig, so contract_tests.zig stays upstream's.
SUMMARY 5 kernels: 5 pass gates 1-4, 0 fail; 5 controls: 5 red as planted.
